==Battleground==
*2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is really easy, even with the lack of a good metal hitter. [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe]] cat is great for getting the zombies to tunnel, chipping away the health of the metal hippoes, and dealing damage to the base while a more stable second line handles the zombies.

